---
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 bg-white border-b border-zinc-200 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: 3D Contractor & Client Handshake Illustration standing cleanly on main page canvas -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex items-center justify-center">
        <img 
          src="/about_3d_handshake.png" 
          alt="3D Contractor and Client Handshake Symbolizing Trust and Partnership" 
          class="w-full max-w-md h-auto object-contain"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Copy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700">ABOUT US</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
            People You Can Depend On.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-base text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Founded on simple, practical business principles, <strong>Aarav Enterprises</strong> supplies dependable, hardworking manpower teams to general contractors, builders, industrial facility managers, warehouse operations, and infrastructure projects across the region.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          We understand that project deadlines don't wait. Whether you need a short-term crew of general labourers for site preparation, certified tradespeople for complex structural work, or ongoing factory shifts, we handle worker vetting, daily attendance, safety orientation, and administrative details.
        </p>

        <!-- Key Operating Principles -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-xs">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-zinc-900 tracking-wider">Operational Integrity</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-1">Honest counts, punctual arrivals, and direct line-of-contact with site managers at all times.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-xs">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-zinc-900 tracking-wider">Complete Flexibility</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-1">Scale crew size up or down based on project phases without long-term overhead commitment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Button -->
        <div class="pt-4">
          <a 
            href="/services" 
            class="editorial-link inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900 hover:text-amber-700"
          >
            <span>Learn More About Our Approach</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
